ikett som bara är synlig för dig och som hjälper dig att skilja mellan dina profiler.";profile_tag_explain,800,V402cbc4d3,9e02cbc56d,MissingTranslation;"Yalnızca sizin için görünebilir bir etiket ayarlayın\; profilleriniz arasındaki farkı anlamanıza yardımcı olur.";profile_tag_explain,801,V40303d7be,820303d83c,MissingTranslation;"Встановіть мітку\, яку бачитимете лише ви\, це допоможе вам розрізняти ваші профілі.";profile_tag_explain,803,V402cda5ac,4402cda5ec,MissingTranslation;"设置仅对您可见的标签，帮助区分您的账号。";profile_tag_explain,804,V402aa9d49,4502aa9d8a,MissingTranslation;"設置僅對您可見的標籤；幫助您區分您的賬戶。";pause_icon_bottom_path_data,815,V400080175,59000801ca,;"M 32 88 L 32 72 L 96 72 L 96 88 Z";incoming_video_call,764,V401b068b1,4301b068f0,MissingTranslation;"Incoming video call";incoming_video_call,767,V401b06e6b,4401b06eab,MissingTranslation;"Videotrucada entrant";incoming_video_call,771,V401b06c9e,4601b06ce0,MissingTranslation;"Eingehender Videoanruf";incoming_video_call,774,V401bc70b7,4501bc70f8,MissingTranslation;"Videollamada entrante";incoming_video_call,775,V401b06db1,4001b06ded,MissingTranslation;"Saabuv videokõne";incoming_video_call,776,V401b06d5f,4401b06d9f,MissingTranslation;"Sarrerako bideo deia";incoming_video_call,777,V4018860dd,410188611a,MissingTranslation;"تماس تصویری ورودی";incoming_video_call,779,V401b17143,4301b17182,MissingTranslation;"Appel vidéo entrant";incoming_video_call,780,V401b06d55,4501b06d96,MissingTranslation;"Videochamada entrante";incoming_video_call,783,V401bc7008,4701bc704b,MissingTranslation;"Videochiamata in arrivo";incoming_video_call,785,V401a3676f,4501a367b0,MissingTranslation;"Asiwel n uvidyu ukcim";incoming_video_call,787,V401825ebc,4b01825f03,MissingTranslation;"Gaunamasis vaizdo skambutis";incoming_video_call,788,V401ac69a3,4701ac69e6,MissingTranslation;"Inkommende videosamtale";incoming_video_call,789,V401b06eec,4501b06f2d,MissingTranslation;"Inkomend videogesprek";incoming_video_call,790,V401c871a4,4d01c871ed,MissingTranslation;"Przych