,V402e3cf7f,6602e3cfe1,MissingTranslation;"Asegúrate de que queres eliminar os datos da túa conta.";delete_account_ask,781,V4028bb77a,59028bb7cf,MissingTranslation;"Biztosan törölni szeretné a profiladatait?";delete_account_ask,782,V4017a5b37,60017a5b93,MissingTranslation;"Apakah anda yakin ingin menghapus data akun anda?";delete_account_ask,783,V402f5d4e3,6302f5d542,MissingTranslation;"Sei certo di voler eliminare i dati del tuo profilo?";delete_account_ask,784,V40167499f,42016749dd,MissingTranslation;"本当にアカウントデータを削除しますか？";delete_account_ask,785,V402c0bf35,5c02c0bf8d,MissingTranslation;"Tebɣiḍ ad tekkseḍ isefka n umaɣnu-inek·inem?";delete_account_ask,786,V401a35a95,3f01a35ad0,MissingTranslation;"정말 계정을 삭제하시겠습니까?";delete_account_ask,787,V40286b025,600286b081,MissingTranslation;"Ar tikrai norite ištrinti savo paskyros duomenis?";delete_account_ask,789,V402e3d221,6802e3d285,MissingTranslation;"Weet je zeker dat je je accountgegevens wilt verwijderen?";delete_account_ask,790,V40307d627,590307d67c,MissingTranslation;"Na pewno chcesz usunąć dane swojego konta?";delete_account_ask,792,V4028cab0e,67028cab71,MissingTranslation;"Tem certeza de que deseja excluir os dados da sua conta?";delete_account_ask,793,V401e27d8d,7101e27dfa,MissingTranslation;"Sunteți sigur că doriți să ștergeți datele contului dumneavoastră?";delete_account_ask,794,V40307d910,640307d970,MissingTranslation;"Вы уверены\, что хотите удалить данные своего профиля?";delete_account_ask,795,V401374bd2,6e01374c3c,MissingTranslation;"Ses seguru de chèrrere iscantzellare sos datos de su contu tuo?";delete_account_ask,796,V4026aa257,59026aa2ac,MissingTranslation;"Naozaj chcete odstrániť údaje svojho účtu?";delete_account_ask,797,V402dbcf46,6a02dbcfac,MissingTranslation;"Jeni i sigurt se doni të fshihen të dhënat e profilit tuaj?";delete_account_ask,798,V401f17b19,7401f17b89,MissingTranslation;"Да ли сте сигурни да желите да избришете све податке са вашег налога?";delete_account_ask,799,V402b3be08,6002b3be64,MissingTranslation;"Är du säker på att du vill ta bort din kontodata?";delete_account_ask,800,V402cfc674,6602cfc6d6,MissingTranslation;"Profil verilerinizi silmek istediğinizden emin misiniz?";delete_account_ask,801,V40307d952,630307d9b1,MissingTranslation;"Ви впевнені\, що хочете видалити дані вашого профілю?";delete_account_ask,802,V401e67fcc,6a01e68032,MissingTranslation;"Bạn có chắc chắn muốn xóa dữ liệu tài khoản của mình không?";delete_account_ask,803,V402d1a6e4,3d02d1a71d,MissingTranslation;"是否确定要删除您的账号数据？";delete_account_ask,804,V402ae9e84,3d02ae9ebd,MissingTranslation;"您確定要刪除您的賬戶數據嗎？";pref_mention_notifications,764,V4030ed412,3f030ed44d,MissingTranslation;"Mentions";pref_mention_notifications,767,V4030de168,3f030de1a3,MissingTranslation;"Mencions";pref_mention_notifications,769,V402edd00d,3d02edd046,MissingTranslation;"Zmínky";pref_mention_notifications,771,V4030dde0f,42030dde4d,MissingTranslation;"Erwähnungen";pref_mention_notifications,774,V4031fe4ed,40031fe529,MissingTranslation;"Menciones";pref_mention_notifications,775,V4030de0bb,41030de0f8,MissingTranslation;"Mainimised";pref_mention_notifications,776,V402f9d784,4002f9d7c0,MissingTranslation;"Aipamenak";pref_mention_notifications,777,V402c7c482,4802c7c4c6,MissingTranslation;"اشاره‌ها(منشن‌ها)";pref_mention_notifications,779,V402fddf44,3f02fddf7f,MissingTranslation;"Mentions";pref_mention_notifications,780,V4030ddea6,3f030ddee1,MissingTranslation;"Mencións";pref_mention_notifications,781,V402b3c5c4,4002b3c600,MissingTranslation;"Említések";pref_mention_notifications,783,V4031fe3fd,3f031fe438,MissingTranslation;"Menzioni";pref_mention_notifications,785,V402eacdd1,3f02eace0c,MissingTranslation;"Tibdarin";pref_mention_notifications,787,V402a9bbf0,4202a9bc2e,MissingTranslation;"Paminėjimai";pref_mention_notifications,789,V4030de0d9,43030de118,MissingTranslation;"Vermeldingen";pref_mention_notifications,790,V40331e50b,3f0331e546,MissingTranslation;"Wzmianki";pref_mention_notifications,794,V40331e859,410331e896,