olti per trasmettere i tuoi messaggi.";chat_new_channel_hint,785,V401dc7599,6b01dc7600,MissingTranslation;"Ibuda d afecku seg waṭas nniḍen i usiweḍ n yiznan-ik·im.";chat_new_channel_hint,788,V401ec7af2,7501ec7b63,MissingTranslation;"Kanaler er et en-til-mange-verktøy for å publisere meldingene dine.";chat_new_channel_hint,789,V401f7838f,6a01f783f5,MissingTranslation;"Kanalen zijn bedoeld om te gebruiken als verzendlijsten.";chat_new_channel_hint,790,V4021b8802,75021b8873,MissingTranslation;"Kanały są narzędziem typu „jeden do wielu” do nadawania wiadomości.";chat_new_channel_hint,791,V4014e5093,7e014e510d,MissingTranslation;"Canais são uma ferramenta de-um-para-muitos para difundir as tuas mensagens.";chat_new_channel_hint,794,V4021b8a1a,94021b8aaa,MissingTranslation;"Каналы представляют собой инструмент одностороннего вещания ваших сообщений множеству получателей.";chat_new_channel_hint,797,V401ef80ac,7701ef811f,MissingTranslation;"Kanalet janë një nga mjete e shumta për transmetim të mesazheve tuaj.";chat_new_channel_hint,799,V401d47621,7a01d47697,MissingTranslation;"Kanaler är ett en-till-många-verktyg för att skicka ut dina meddelanden.";chat_new_channel_hint,800,V401e579a4,7201e57a12,MissingTranslation;"Kanallar\, iletilerinizi yayınlamak için birden çoğa bir araçtır.";chat_new_channel_hint,801,V4021b8a2b,7f021b8aa6,MissingTranslation;"Канали - це інструмент \"один до багатьох\" для трансляції ваших повідомлень.";chat_new_channel_hint,803,V401e56919,4001e56955,MissingTranslation;"频道是广播消息的一对多工具。";chat_new_channel_hint,804,V401ca6279,4401ca62b9,MissingTranslation;"頻道是一種用於一對多廣播訊息的工具。";qrshow_x_verified,764,V4041532a3,3e041532dd,MissingTranslation;"%1$s introduced.";qrshow_x_verified,765,V4016d5a25,3e016d5a5f,MissingTranslation;"%1$s yoxlanıldı.";qrshow_x_verified,766,V4030af557,3e030af591,MissingTranslation;"%1$s е проверен.";qrshow_x_verified,805,V401b1615d,3e01b16197,MissingTranslation;"%1$s تاییڌ وابی.";qrshow_x_verified,767,V40413470f,3a04134745,MissingTransla