ranslation;"Μετά την εγγραφή\, πατήστε δύο φορές για αποστολή. Για να απορρίψετε την εγγραφή\, τρίψτε με δύο δάχτυλα.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,774,V404bf7fe3,b204bf8091,MissingTranslation;"Después de grabar\, toque dos veces para enviar. Para descartar la grabación\, deslice de izquierda a derecha con dos dedos.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,775,V404ad76d6,9904ad776b,MissingTranslation;"Peale salvestamist saad topeltpuudutusega saata. Salvestisest saad loobuda hõõrudes kahe sõrmega.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,776,V40481678b,940481681b,MissingTranslation;"Grabatu ondoren\, sakatu bi aldiz bidaltzeko. Grabazioa baztertzeko\, pasatu bi hatz gainetik.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,777,V404474d6f,9204474dfd,MissingTranslation;"پس از ضبط کردن برای ارسال دوبار ضربه بزنید. برای حذف و رد ضبط کردن با دو انگشت خود بکشید.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,778,V4038d1623,b7038d16d6,MissingTranslation;"Nauhoittamisen jälkeen napauta kahdesti lähettääksesi. Hylätäksesi nauhoitteen pyyhkäise vasemmalta oikealle kahdella sormella.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,779,V40485757f,a604857621,MissingTranslation;"Après l'enregistrement\, poussez deux fois pour envoyer. Pour le supprimer\, balayez l'écran avec deux doigts.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,780,V404ad75c7,9504ad7658,MissingTranslation;"Tras gravar\, preme dúas veces para enviar. Para desbotar a gravación\, desliza cos dous dedos.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,781,V4041f4c94,9f041f4d2f,MissingTranslation;"A felvétel rögzítése után duplán koppintson a küldéshez. A felvétel elvetéséhez csúsztassa két ujjával.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,783,V404bf7c24,9e04bf7cbe,MissingTranslation;"Dopo la registrazione\, doppio tocco per inviare. Per scartare la registrazione\, striscia con due dita.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,785,V40471598a,8f04715a15,MissingTranslation;"Seld asekles\, sit snat n tikkal i tuzna. Akken ad tekkseḍ asekles\, sfeḍ s sin yiḍarren.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,786,V402e1b5de,6702e1b641,MissingTranslation;"녹화가 끝나면 두 번 눌러 전송합니다. 기록을 삭제하려면 두 손가락으로 문지르십시오.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,789,V404ad78f3,aa04ad7999,MissingTranslation;"Dubbeltik op de opname om hem te versturen. Veeg met twee vingers van links naar rechts om de opname af te breken.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,790,V404d17c11,9504d17ca2,MissingTranslation;"Po nagraniu dotknij dwukrotnie\, aby wysłać. Aby odrzucić nagranie\, przeciągnij dwoma palcami.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,792,V403e52467,9903e524fc,MissingTranslation;"Após a gravação\, toque duas vezes para enviar. Para descartar a gravação\, deslize com dois dedos.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,794,V404d17fef,9604d18081,MissingTranslation;"После записи дважды нажмите\, чтобы отправить. Чтобы отменить запись\, проведите двумя пальцами.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,796,V403d721c0,a903d72265,MissingTranslation;"Po zaznamenaní nahrávky ju dvojitým klepnutím odošlete. Nahrávku zahodíte potiahnutím dvoma prstami vľavo-vpravo.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,797,V404a5743b,b104a574e8,MissingTranslation;"Pas regjistrimit\, prekeni dy herë që të dërgohet. Për ta hedhur regjistrimin tej\, fërkojeni majtas-djathtas me dy gishta.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,798,V40348f0dd,9c0348f175,MissingTranslation;"Након снимања\, двапут додирните да бисте послали. Да бисте одбацили снимак\, трљајте га са два прста.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,799,V404635ab2,a304635b51,MissingTranslation;"Efter inspelningen dubbelklickar du för att skicka. För att förkasta inspelningen\, skrubba med två fingrar.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,800,V404956a70,8c04956af8,MissingTranslation;"Kaydettikten sonra göndermek için çift dokunun. Kaydı atmak için iki parmakla sarın.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,801,V404d18011,9104d1809e,MissingTranslation;"Після запису двічі торкніться для відправки. Щоб скинути запис\, проведіть двома пальцями.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,802,V4034cf966,84034cf9e6,MissingTranslation;"Sau khi ghi\, nhấn đúp để gửi. Để loại bỏ bản ghi\, hãy chà bằng hai ngón tay.";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,803,V4049b25b4,54049b2604,MissingTranslation;"录制后，点按两次即可发送。如需舍弃录制内容，请双指滑动。";a11y_voice_message_hint_ios,804,V4045f17c0,54045f1810,MissingTranslation;"錄製后，按兩下以傳送。要放棄錄製內容，請用兩根手指劃動。";switch_between_chats,764,V404955d2a,4504955d6b,MissingTranslation;"Switch between Chats";switch_between_chats,766,V4037119ab,4c037119f3,MissingTranslation;"Превключване между чатовете";switch_between_chats,767,V4049574d0,420495750e,MissingTranslation;"Canvia entre xats";switch_between_chats,769,V404514f19,4504514f5a,MissingTranslation;"Přepínání mezi chaty";switch_between_chats,771,V4049570cf,440495710f,MissingTranslation;"Chats durchschalten";switch_between_chats,772,V402f4e388,4b02f4e3cf,MissingTranslation;"Εναλλαγή μεταξύ συνομιλιών";switch_between_chats,774,V404a778e5,4504a77926,MissingTranslation;"Alternar entre chats";switch_between_chats,775,V404956fc6,4004957002,MissingTranslation;"Vaheta vestlusi";switch_between_chats,776,V4046b613a,45046b617b,MissingTranslation;"Aldatu txaten artean";switch_between_chats,777,V404314751,4704314794,MissingTranslation;"جابه‌جا شدن میان گپ‌ها";switch_between_chats,778,V403770fec,4d03771035,MissingTranslation;"Siirry keskustelusta toiseen";switch_between_chats,779,V4046f6efa,4f046f6f45,MissingTranslation;"Naviguer entre les discussions";switch_between_chats,780,V404956ecd,4804956f11,MissingTranslation;"Cambiar entre conversas";switch_between_chats,781,V4040b463f,4b040b4686,MissingTranslation;"Váltás a csevegések között";switch_between_chats,783,V404a77535,4d04a7757e,MissingTranslation;"Passa da una Chat all'altra";switch_between_chats,785,V4045d5369,47045d53ac,MissingTranslation;"Senfel gar Idiwenniyen";switch_between_chats,786,V402d0b18a,3802d0b1be,MissingTranslation;"채팅 간 전환";switch_between_chats,787,V403d723e4,4803d72428,MissingTranslation;"Perjungti tarp pokalbių";switch_between_chats,789,V404957209,450495724a,MissingTranslation;"Wisselen van gesprek";switch_between_chats,790,V404b9753a,4c04b97582,MissingTranslation;"Przełącz się między czatami";s