e mantieni per registrare un messaggio vocale\, rilascia per inviare";chat_record_explain,784,V4010f347c,42010f34ba,MissingTranslation;"長押しして録音して、離すと送ります。";chat_record_explain,785,V401df76bf,6b01df7726,MissingTranslation;"Sit u ṭṭef akken ad teskelseḍ izen n taɣect\, serreḥ i tuzna";chat_record_explain,786,V401303e19,4a01303e5f,MissingTranslation;"꾹 눌러 음성 메시지를 녹음하고\, 떼서 보내시오";chat_record_explain,787,V401c16eff,8701c16f82,MissingTranslation;"Bakstelėkite ir laikykite\, norėdami įrašyti balso žinutę. Atleiskite\, norėdami išsiųsti";chat_record_explain,788,V401ef7c95,6801ef7cf9,MissingTranslation;"Trykk og hold for å ta opp en melding\, slipp for å sende";chat_record_explain,789,V401fa84c9,7901fa853e,MissingTranslation;"Houd ingedrukt om een spraakbericht op te nemen\; laat los om te versturen";chat_record_explain,790,V4021e8947,78021e89bb,MissingTranslation;"Dotknij i przytrzymaj\, aby nagrać wiadomość głosową\, zwolnij\, aby wysłać";chat_record_explain,791,V401515260,71015152cd,MissingTranslation;"Toque e segure para gravar uma mensagem de voz\, solte para enviar";chat_record_explain,792,V401e87718,7b01e8778f,MissingTranslation;"Toque e segure para gravar uma mensagem de voz e\, depois\, solte para enviar";chat_record_explain,793,V40153501a,890153509f,MissingTranslation;"Atingeți continuu pentru a înregistra un mesaj vocal\, apoi eliberați-l pentru a-l trimite";chat_record_explain,794,V4021e8b87,7d021e8c00,MissingTranslation;"Нажмите и удерживайте для записи голосового сообщения\, отпустите для отправки";chat_record_explain,795,V400f1367d,8100f136fa,MissingTranslation;"Incarca e mantene incarcadu pro registrare unu messàgiu vocale\, lassa pro imbiare";chat_record_explain,796,V401b268e9,7301b26958,MissingTranslation;"Klepnutím a podržaním nahráte hlasovú správu\, uvoľnením ju odošlete";chat_record_explain,797,V401f281f1,8801f28275,MissingTranslation;"Prekeni dhe mbajeni të prekur që të incizoni një mesazh zanor\; lëshojeni\, që të dërgohet";chat_record_explain,798,V4017657e0,6f0176584b,MissingTranslation;"Додирните и држите за снимање гласовне поруке\, пустите за слање";chat_record_explain,799,V401d777e2,7d01d7785b,MissingTranslation;"Tryck och håll ner för att spela in ett röstmeddelande\, släpp för att skicka.";chat_record_explain,800,V401e87ae4,7e01e87b5e,MissingTranslation;"Bir sesli ileti kaydetmek için dokunun ve basılı tutun\, göndermek için bırakın";chat_record_explain,801,V4021e8b76,85021e8bf7,MissingTranslation;"Натиснувши втримуйте\, щоби записати голосове повідомлення\, а для відправки відпустіть";chat_record_explain,802,V4014b4ecc,60014b4f28,MissingTranslation;"Nhấn và giữ để ghi tin nhắn thoại\, thả ra để gửi";chat_record_explain,803,V401e869df,4101e86a1c,MissingTranslation;"按住即可录制语音消息，松开即可发送";chat_record_explain,804,V401cd6345,3a01cd637b,MissingTranslation;"按住錄音，放開後傳送";pref_reliable_service,764,V404d975a9,4d04d975f2,MissingTranslation;"Force Background Connection";pref_reliable_service,767,V404d78f1c,5004d78f68,MissingTranslation;"Força la connexió en segon pla";pref_reliable_service,769,V404916767,4d049167b0,MissingTranslation;"Vynutit připojení na pozadí";pref_reliable_service,771,V404d78b1d,5104d78b6a,MissingTranslation;"Hintergrundverbindung erzwingen";pref_reliable_service,774,V404e992bf,5204e9930d,MissingTranslation;"Forzar conexión en segundo plano";pref_reliable_service,775,V404d7899b,4904d789e0,MissingTranslation;"Kasuta ühendust taustal";pref_reliable_service,776,V404ab7a44,5104ab7a91,MissingTranslation;"Behartu atzeko planoko konexioa";pref_reliable_service,777,V404715f8f,4b04715fd6,MissingTranslation;"اجبار کردن اتصال پس‌زمینه";pref_reliable_service,778,V403a92291,4903a922d6,MissingTranslation;"Pakota yhteys taustalla";pref_reliable_service,779,V404af895c,5504af89ad,MissingTranslation;"Forcer la connexion en arrière-plan";pref_reliable_service,780,V404d78894,5204d788e2,MissingTranslation;"Forzar Conexión en Segundo Plano";pref_reliable_service,781,V4044b6157,4f044b61a2,MissingTranslation;"Kényszerített