an bisa kembali menerima pesan dari kontak ini.";ask_unblock_contact,783,V401e47d3e,4a01e47d84,MissingTranslation;"Sbloccare questo contatto?";ask_unblock_contact,784,V400f32ea5,4100f32ee2,MissingTranslation;"この連絡先の拒否設定を解除しますか";ask_unblock_contact,785,V401ba6dad,4901ba6df2,MissingTranslation;"Kkes asewḥel i unermis-a";ask_unblock_contact,786,V401123785,5d011237de,MissingTranslation;"연락처 차단을 해제하시겠습니까? 이 연락처로부터 다시 메시지를 받을 수 있습니다.";ask_unblock_contact,787,V4019a657a,7b019a65f1,MissingTranslation;"Atblokuoti šį adresatą? Jūs ir vėl galėsite gauti žinutes nuo šio adresato.";ask_unblock_contact,788,V401ca727d,8601ca72ff,MissingTranslation;"Fjern blokkering av denne kontakten? Du vil igjen kunne motta meldinger fra kontakten.";ask_unblock_contact,789,V401d57a4d,8001d57ac9,MissingTranslation;"Wil je deze contactpersoon deblokkeren? Hij/zij kan je wederom berichten sturen.";ask_unblock_contact,790,V401f37ea3,4701f37ee6,MissingTranslation;"Odblokować ten kontakt?";ask_unblock_contact,791,V40132490d,8001324989,MissingTranslation;"Desbloquear esse contacto? Poderá mais uma vez receber mensagens deste contacto.";ask_unblock_contact,792,V401c26cab,7001c26d17,MissingTranslation;"Desbloquear este contato? Você voltará a receber mensagens dele.";ask_unblock_contact,793,V4012f470d,80012f4789,MissingTranslation;"Deblocați acest contact? Astfel\, veți putea primi mesaje de la această persoană.";ask_unblock_contact,794,V401f380c8,4c01f38110,MissingTranslation;"Разблокировать этот контакт?";ask_unblock_contact,795,V400d22d8e,8300d22e0d,MissingTranslation;"Isblocare custu cuntatu? As a torrare a pòdere retzire messàgios dae custu cuntatu.";ask_unblock_contact,796,V401895db5,7c01895e2d,MissingTranslation;"Odblokovať tento kontakt? Z tohto kontaktu budete opäť môcť dostávať správy.";ask_unblock_contact,797,V401cd7833,4a01cd7879,MissingTranslation;"Të zhbllokohet ky kontakt?";ask_unblock_contact,798,V401504ddc,8b01504e63,MissingTranslation;"Да ли желите да деблокирате овај контакт? Биће вам омогућено да опет примате поруке од њих.";ask_unblock_contact,799,V401b26d2a,9e01b26dc4,MissingTranslation;"Vill du avblockera den här kontakten? Du kommer återigen att kunna ta emot meddelanden från den här kontakten.";ask_unblock_contact,800,V401c371b0,4901c371f5,MissingTranslation;"Bu kişi engellenmesin mi?";ask_unblock_contact,801,V401f380bb,4901f38100,MissingTranslation;"Розблокувати цей контакт?";ask_unblock_contact,802,V4012d474d,6e012d47b7,MissingTranslation;"Bỏ chặn liên hệ này? Sau đó bạn sẽ có thể nhận tin nhắn từ họ.";ask_unblock_contact,803,V401c66304,3901c66339,MissingTranslation;"取消屏蔽此联系人？";ask_unblock_contact,804,V401ab5c3d,4701ab5c80,MissingTranslation;"要解除封鎖嗎？你之後可以繼續收到這個人的訊息。";disabled_in_dc,764,V404b96806,4104b96843,MissingTranslation;"Disabled in Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,766,V403932558,4103932595,MissingTranslation;"Забранено в Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,767,V404b9808f,4204b980cd,MissingTranslation;"Desactivat a Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,769,V40471598c,47047159cf,MissingTranslation;"Zakázáno aplikací Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,771,V404b97c63,4404b97ca3,MissingTranslation;"Deaktiviert in Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,772,V40315eec2,4a0315ef08,MissingTranslation;"Απενεργοποιήθηκε στο Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,774,V404cb8486,4604cb84c8,MissingTranslation;"Deshabilitado en Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,775,V404b97b5a,4604b97b9c,MissingTranslation;"Pole Delta Chatis kasutusel";disabled_in_dc,776,V4048d6bf5,41048d6c32,MissingTranslation;"Desgaitu Delta Chat-en";disabled_in_dc,777,V4045351a1,47045351e4,MissingTranslation;"در دلتاچت غیر فعال شده است.";disabled_in_dc,778,V403991aa4,4703991ae7,MissingTranslation;"Kytketty pois Delta Chatissa";disabled_in_dc,779,V404917a2c,4404917a6c,MissingTranslation;"Désactivé dans Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,780,V404b97a2d,4404b97a6d,MissingTranslation;"Desactivado en Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,781,V4042b5253,43042b5292,MissingTranslation;"Letiltva a Delta Chatben";disabled_in_dc,783,V404cb80ac,4504cb80ed,MissingTranslation;"Disabilitato in Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,785,V4047d5df2,43047d5e31,MissingTranslation;"Ittwasens deg Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,786,V402edb93a,3d02edb973,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat에서 비활성화됨";disabled_in_dc,787,V403ed2ac6,4b03ed2b0d,MissingTranslation;"Išjungta Delta Chat programėlėje";disabled_in_dc,789,V404b97dd8,4604b97e1a,MissingTranslation;"Uitgeschakeld in Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,790,V404dd8080,3e04dd80ba,MissingTranslation;"Wyłącz w Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,792,V403f128ea,4303f12929,MissingTranslation;"Desativado no Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,794,V404dd848a,4204dd84c8,MissingTranslation;"Отключено в Delta Chat.";disabled_in_dc,796,V403e32649,4103e32686,MissingTranslation;"Vypnuté v Delta Chat-e";disabled_in_dc,797,V404b178a7,4404b178e7,MissingTranslation;"Çaktivizuar në Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,798,V40354f569,430354f5a8,MissingTranslation;"Онемогућено у Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,799,V4046f5f2d,43046f5f6c,MissingTranslation;"Inaktiverad i Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,800,V404a16ed1,4c04a16f19,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat'ten etkisizleştirildi";disabled_in_dc,801,V404dd847d,4004dd84b9,MissingTranslation;"Вимкнено в Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,802,V40358fd8b,420358fdc9,MissingTranslation;"Đã tắt trong Delta Chat";disabled_in_dc,803,V404a728a9,3c04a728e1,MissingTranslation;"在 Delta Chat 中被禁用";disabled_in_dc,804,V4046b1aba,3c046b1af2,MissingTranslation;"在 Delta Chat 中已禁用";new_classic_contact_explain,764,V401073adf,a101073b7c,MissingTranslation;"Manually added contacts can be used to text to classic email and are not guaranteed end-to-end encrypted.";new_classic_contact_explain,766,V400c92e33,f700c92f26,MissingTranslation;"С помощта на ръчно добавените контакти можете да пращате текстови съобщение до получатели\, използващи класическа електронна поща. Не е гарантирано\, че те ще са криптирани \"от край до край\".";new_classic_contact_explain,767,V401073db8,c401073e78,MissingTranslation;"Els contactes afegits manualment es poden usar per a enviar correus electrònics clàssics i no es garanteix que se xifrin d'extrem a extrem.";new_classic_contact_explain,769,V401194057,9e011940f1,MissingTranslation;"Ručně přidané kontakty lze použít k posílání zpráv klasickým e-mailem bez garance koncového šifrování.";new_classic_contact_explain,771,V401073cd1,d301073da0,MissingTranslation;"Manuell hinzugefügte Kontakte können verwendet werden\, um klassische E-Mail-Adressen anzuschreiben\; diese sind nicht garantiert Ende-zu-Ende-verschlüsselt.";new_classic_contact_explain,774,V401113f58,f90111404d,MissingTranslation;"Los contactos añadidos manualmente se pueden utilizar para enviar mensajes a contactos que usan clientes de correo electrónico clásico y no se garantiza que estén cifrados de extremo a extremo.";new_classic_contact_explain,775,V401073d52,c701073e15,MissingTranslation;"Käsitsi lisatud kontakte saad kasutada sõnumite saatmiseks klassikalistele e-posti kontodele ning nende sõnumite läbiv krüptimine pole tagatud.";new_classic_contact_explain,776,V401073d4d,c401073e0d,MissingTranslation;"Eskuz gehitutako kontaktuak eposta helbide klasikoetara idazteko erabil daitezke\, eta ez da bermatzen muturretik muturrera zifratuta egotea.";new_classic_contact_explain,777,V400f335f6,c100f336b3,MissingTranslation;"مخاطبینی که دستی اضافه شده‌اند می توانند برای ارسال پیام به حساب رایانامه معمولی استفاده شوند و رمزگذاری سراسری برای آن‌ها تضمین نمی‌شود.";new_classic_contact_explain,778,V400c92cc8,ba00c92d7e,MissingTranslation;"Manuaalisesti lisättyjä yhteystietoja voidaan käyttää tavanomaisiin sähköposteihin ja niiden päästä-päähän salausta ei ole taattu.";new_classic_contact_explain,779,V4010a3ed6,bb010a3f8d,MissingTranslation;"Les contacts ajoutés manuellement peuvent être contactés par courriel classique. Le chiffrement de bout en bout n'est pas garanti.";new_classic_contact_explain,780,V401073d54,c701073e17,MissingTranslation;"Os contactos engadidos á man poden usarse para enviar os correos electrónicos tradicionais e non teñen garantida a cifraxe de extremo-a-extremo";new_classic_contact_explain,781,V400f336f3,ca00f337b9,MissingTranslation;"A kézzel hozzáadott névjegyek szöveges üzenetek küldésére használhatók a klasszikus e-mailekhez és nem garantált a végpontok közötti titkosításuk.";new_classic_contact_explain,783,V401113f00,cb01113fc7,MissingTranslation;"I contatti aggiunti manualmente possono essere utilizzati per inviare testo all' e-mail classica e non sono garantiti con crittografia end-to-end.";new_classic_contact_explain,785,V401003b7f,bc01003c37,MissingTranslation;"Inermisen yettwarnan s ufus zemren ad ttwasqedcen i uḍris n yimayl aklasiki\, yerna ur ttwaḍemnen ara tawgelhant seg yixef ɣer wayeḍ.";new_classic_contact_explain,787,V400ed350d,ba00ed35c3,MissingTranslation;"Rankiniu būdu pridėtiems adresatams galima rašyti klasikinius el. laiškus\, kurie\, negarantuojama\, jog bus šifruoti ištisiniu būdu.";new_classic_contact_explain,788,V401053b3e,a701053be1,MissingTranslation;"Manuelle kontakter kan brukes til å sende tekst til klassisk e-post og er ikke garantert ende-til-ende-kryptert";new_classic_contact_explain,789,V401073df4,c801073eb8,MissingTranslation;"Handmatig toegevoegde contactpersonen zijn bedoeld voor traditionele e-mailcommunicatie - eind-tot-endversleuteling is daarom niet gegarandeerd.";new_classic_contact_explain,790,V4011b40c6,ca011b418c,MissingTranslation;"Ręcznie dodane kontakty mogą być używane do wysyłania tekstu w klasycznych e-mailach i nie ma gwarancji\, że będą one szyfrowane metodą end-to-end.";new_classic_contact_explain,794,V4011b41fc,d3011b42cb,MissingTranslation;"Контакты\, добавленные вручную\, можно использовать для отправки текстовых сообщений по обычной электронной почте\, без гарантированного сквозного шифрования.";new_classic_contact_explain,797,V400ff3bb4,b800ff3c68,MissingTranslation;"Kontaktet e shtuar dorazi mund të përdoren për të dërguar tekst te email klasik dhe për ta s’garantohet fshehtëzim skaj-më-skaj.";new_classic_contact_explain,799,V4