769,V4046b5778,a5046b5819,MissingTranslation;"Pro focení\, natáčení a skenování QR kódů\, otevřete systémová nastavení a povolte \"Fotoaparát\".";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,771,V404b37a20,c404b37ae0,MissingTranslation;"Um Fotos oder Videos aufzunehmen oder den QR-Code-Scanner zu verwenden\, öffne die Systemeinstellungen und aktiviere \"Kamera\".";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,772,V4030fec66,e1030fed43,MissingTranslation;"Για να τραβήξετε φωτογραφίες\, να τραβήξετε βίντεο ή να χρησιμοποιήσετε το σαρωτή QR-Code\, ανοίξτε τις ρυθμίσεις συστήματος και ενεργοποιήστε την \"Κάμερα\".";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,774,V404c58255,bd04c5830e,MissingTranslation;"Para hacer fotos\, capturar vídeos o utilizar el escáner de códigos QR\, abra los ajustes del sistema y active \"Cámara\".";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,775,V404b3791c,c704b379df,MissingTranslation;"Pildistamiseks\, videote salvestamiseks ja QR-koodide skaneerimiseks ava süsteemi seadistused ja luba rakendusel kasutada kaamerat.";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,776,V4048769d1,c304876a90,MissingTranslation;"Argazkiak ateratzeko\, bideoak grabatzeko edo QR kodeen eskanerra erabiltzeko\, ireki sistemaren ezarpenak eta gaitu \"Kamera\".";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,777,V4044d4f90,ae044d503a,MissingTranslation;"برای عکس یا فیلم گرفتن یا اسکن کردن کد کیو آر، وارد تنظیم‌های سیستم شده و دسترسی به دوربین را فعال کنید.";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,778,V403931881,ba03931937,MissingTranslation;"Avaa järjestelmäasetukset ja kytke päälle \"Kamera\" ottaaksesi kuvia tai videoita tai käyttääksesi QR-koodinlukijaa.";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,779,V4048b77e0,cc048b78a8,MissingTranslation;"Pour prendre des photos\, des vidéos ou utiliser le scanneur de QR-Code\, ouvrez les paramètres du système et activez \"Appareil photo\".";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,780,V404b3780f,ae04b378b9,MissingTranslation;"Para facer fotos\, vídeos ou usar o escáner de Códigos-QR\, abre os axustes do sistema e activa \"Cámara\".";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,781,V404254ee2,14d0425502b,MissingTranslation;"A fényképek-\, videók- vagy QR-kódok rögzítéséhez lépjen a rendszer beállításaiba\, válassza ki a „Alkalmazások és értesítések” menüpontot\, válassza ki az DeltaChat alkalmazást\, majd koppintson az „Engedélyek” menüpontra\, és engedélyezze a hozzáférést a „Kamerához”.";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,783,V404c57e7d,c104c57f3a,MissingTranslation;"Per scattare foto\, filmare video o usare la scansione Codice QR\, apri le impostazioni di sistema e autorizza \"Fotocamera\".";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,785,V404775bbe,ca04775c84,MissingTranslation;"Akken ad d-teṭṭfeḍ tiwlafin\, tuṭṭfa n tvidyutin neɣ ad tesqedceḍ aḍummu n tengalt QR\, ldi iɣewwaṛen n unagraw u rmed \" takamirat \".";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,786,V402e7b79b,8102e7b818,MissingTranslation;"사진 찍기\, 비디오 캡쳐 혹은 QR-Code 스캐너를 이용하려면\, 환경설정에서 \"카메라\"를 활성화하시오.";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,789,V404b37b61,e504b37c42,MissingTranslation;"Voor het maken van foto's\, opnemen van video's en gebruik van de QR-codescanner is cameratoegang vereist. Open de systeeminstellingen en verleen deze toegang.";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,790,V404d77e63,b104d77f10,MissingTranslation;"Aby robić zdjęcia\, nagrywać filmy lub używać skanera kodów QR\, otwórz ustawienia systemowe i włącz „Aparat”.";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,792,V403eb26ba,b903eb276f,MissingTranslation;"Para tirar fotos\, capturar vídeos ou usar o escâner de QR-Code\, abra as configurações do sistema e ative \"Câmera\".";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,794,V404d7823c,c804d78300,MissingTranslation;"Чтобы делать фотографии\, снимать видео и использовать сканер QR-кодов\, откройте системные настройки и включите доступ к \"Камере\".";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,796,V403dd241e,c103dd24db,MissingTranslation;"Na vyhotovenie fotografií\, záznam videa alebo použitie čítačky QR kódov otvorte nastavenia systému a povoľte \"Fotoaparát\".";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,797,V404ab7680,bd04ab7739,MissingTranslation;"Për të bërë foto\, regjistruar video ose përdorur skanerin QR-Code\, hapni rregullimet e sistemit dhe aktivizoni “Kamera”.";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,798,V4034ef333,c8034ef3f7,MissingTranslation;"Да би направили фотографије\, видео записе или читач бар-кôда\, отворите поставке на оперативном систему и омогућите приступу камери.";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,799,V404695cfc,b904695db1,MissingTranslation;"För att ta bilder\, spela in videor eller använda QR-kodläsaren\, öppna systeminställningarna och aktivera \"Kamera\".";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,800,V4049b6ca0,c9049b6d65,MissingTranslation;"Fotoğraflar çekmek\, videolar yakalamak ya da QR Kodu tarayıcısını kullanmak için sistem ayarlarını açın ve “Kamera”yı etkinleştirin.";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,801,V404d7824b,bd04d78304,MissingTranslation;"Щоб фотографувати\, знімати відео або використовувати сканер QR-коду\, відкрийте налаштування системи та ввімкніть камеру.";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,802,V40352fb8b,a60352fc2d,MissingTranslation;"Để chụp ảnh\, quay video hoặc sử dụng trình quét Mã QR\, hãy mở cài đặt hệ thống và bật \"Camera\".";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,803,V404a1273a,6304a12799,MissingTranslation;"要拍照、拍摄视频或扫描二维码，请打开系统设置并启用“相机”。";perm_ios_explain_access_to_camera_denied,804,V404651946,66046519a8,MissingTranslation;"要拍照、攝錄影片或使用QR碼掃描器，請打開系統設定並啟用「相機」。";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,764,V404d17260,8b04d172e7,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat will let you choose which photos from your library to send.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,766,V4039d2afe,93039d2b8d,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat ще Ви даде да изберете кои снимки от Вашата библотека да изпратите.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,767,V404cf8b82,9104cf8c0f,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat us permetrà triar quines fotos de la biblioteca s'han d'enviar.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,768,V40208880d,8e02088897,MissingTranslation;"دێڵتا چات ڕێگە دەدات خۆت هەڵیبژێری کە کام وێنە لە پیشانگاکەتەوە بنێردرێت.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,769,V40489641e,8a048964a4,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat vás nechá vybrat\, které fotky z galerie si přejete poslat.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,770,V4028cb3a2,92028cb430,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat vil lade dig vælge hvilke billeder fra dit bibliotek du vil sende.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,771,V404cf8771,a904cf8816,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat verwendet die Fotos\, um dir die Möglichkeit zu geben\, diese auszuwählen und zu versenden.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,772,V40320f48b,a50320f52c,MissingTranslation;"Το Delta Chat θα σας επιτρέψει να επιλέξετε ποιες φωτογραφίες από τη βιβλιοθήκη σας θα στείλετε.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,774,V404e18f2a,9604e18fbc,MissingTranslation;"Al permitir el acceso a la galería de fotos podrás subir tus imágenes desde allí.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,775,V404cf8616,8304cf8695,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat võimaldab sul valida fotosid teistele edastamiseks.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,776,V404a376a9,9e04a37743,MissingTranslation;"Argazkien bilduma atzitzeko baimena emateak bertatik argazkiak igotzea ahalbidetzen dizu.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,777,V404695c25,8804695ca9,MissingTranslation;"دلتاچت به شما اجازه می دهد تصویر موردنظر برای ارسال را انتخاب کنید.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,778,V403a31ff4,8e03a3207e,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat antaa sinun valita\, mitkä kuvat kirjastostasi haluat lähettää.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,779,V404a7858e,9104a7861b,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat vous laisse choisir quelles photos envoyer de votre photothèque.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,780,V404cf8526,8904cf85ab,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat permitirache escoller que fotos da túa biblioteca enviar.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,781,V404435da0,a704435e43,MissingTranslation;"A Delta Chat segítségével kiválaszthatja\, hogy mely fényképeket szeretné elküldeni a könyvtárából.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,782,V402489abb,9902489b50,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat akan memungkinkan Anda memilih foto dari perpustakaan Anda untuk dikirim.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,783,V404e18bf0,9104e18c7d,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat ti permetterà di scegliere quali foto della tua libreria inviare.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,785,V404956880,920495690e,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat ad k-yeǧǧ ad tferneḍ anwa tiwlafin seg temkarḍit-ik·im ara tazneḍ.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,786,V402f8bd79,6f02f8bde4,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat 을 통해 라이브러리에서 보낼 사진을 선택할 수 있습니다.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,787,V403f52d22,9403f52db2,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat leis jums pasirinkti\, kurias nuotraukas iš savo kolekcijos išsiųsti.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,789,V404cf88a1,8904cf8926,MissingTranslation;"Geef Delta Chat toegang tot je foto's om afbeeldingen te versturen.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,790,V404f38b19,9104f38ba6,MissingTranslation;"Zezwolenie na dostęp do biblioteki zdjęć umożliwia przesyłanie z niej zdjęć.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,792,V403fb2e88,8f03fb2f13,MissingTranslation;"O Delta Chat permite que você escolha fotos de sua biblioteca para enviar.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,794,V404f38fab,a404f3904b,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat предоставит вам возможность выбирать какие фотографии и из какой галереи отправлять.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,796,V403ef2be7,9703ef2c7a,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat vám umožní zvoliť si\, ktoré fotografie z vašej knižnice chcete odoslať.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,797,V404c78385,9604c78417,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat-i do t’ju lejojë të zgjidhni cilat foto të dërgohen nga fototeka juaj.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,798,V4035ffab7,a4035ffb57,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat ће вам дозволити да изаберете које од слика из вашег фото албума желите да пошаљете.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,799,V4048769ec,9204876a7a,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat låter dig välja vilka bilder från ditt galleri som du vill skicka.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,800,V404b979b3,9a04b97a49,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat\, kitaplığınızdan hangi fotoğrafların gönderileceğini seçmenize izin verir.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,801,V404f38f79,8804f38ffd,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat дасть Вам обрати\, які фото з Вашої бібліотеки надіслати.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,802,V4036302b2,7c0363032a,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat sẽ cho phép bạn chọn ảnh từ thư viện để gửi.";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,803,V404bd316b,6104bd31c8,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat 将让您选择要从图库中发送哪些照片。";InfoPlist_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription,804,V40481237a,60048123d6,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat 將讓您從圖庫中選擇要傳送的照片。";always_load_remote_images,764,V40058147e,4f005814c9,MissingTranslation;"Always Load Remote Images";always_load_remote_images,766,V4004010b3,6400401113,MissingTranslation;"Винаги да се зареждат отдалечените изображения";always_load_remote_images,805,V40050122a,5200501278,MissingTranslation;"شؽواتا دیر ز دسرس هی بوگوئشن";always_load_remote_images,767,V4005815fb,580058164f,MissingTranslation;"Carrega sempre les imatges remotes";always_load_remote_images,769,V400581609,5300581658,MissingTranslation;"Vždy načítat vzdálené obrázky";always_load_remote_images,771,V400581595,4c005815dd,MissingTranslation;"Bilder immer nachladen";always_load_remote_images,773,V4004d1278,4f004d12c3,MissingTranslation;"Ĉiam ŝargu forajn bildojn";always_load_remote_images,774,V4005815c1,5500581612,MissingTranslation;"Cargar siempre imágenes remot