dir\, lakin bu\, əbədi imtina edilmişdir. Proqramın sistem ayarlarına gedib \"İcazələr\"-i seçin və \"kamera\" izni verin.";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,766,V4033905cc,c803390690,MissingTranslation;"За да правите снимки или заснемате видеоклипове\, отидете в настройките на приложението\, изберете \"Позволения\" и разрешете \"Камера\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,767,V4044f5bfd,103044f5cfc,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat demana accés a la càmera per poder fer fotos o vídeos\, però li ha estat denegat. Sisplau\, vés al menú de configuració de l'app\, busca-hi els \"Permisos\" i habilita'n la \"Càmera\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,768,V401dd7883,a901dd7928,MissingTranslation;"بۆ فلیم و وێنە گرتن، بچۆ بەشی ڕێکخستنەکانی نەرمامێرەکە، لە بەشی \"ڕێگەپێدان\"دا، \"کامێرا\" چالاک بکەوە.";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,769,V404133b59,b004133c05,MissingTranslation;"Pro focení a natáčení přejděte do nastavení aplikace\, vyberte \"Oprávnění\" a povolte oprávnění \"Fotoaparát\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,770,V402559faf,fc0255a0a7,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat kræver kamera tilladelse for at tage billeder eller video men det er blevet afvist permanent. Fortsæt til program opsætning menu og vælg \"Tilladelser\" og aktivere \"Kamera\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,771,V4044f5860,b4044f5910,MissingTranslation;"Um Fotos oder Videos aufzunehmen\, bitte in den System-Einstellungen DeltaChat den Zugriff auf die Kamera erlauben.";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,772,V402bdd0b0,d202bdd17e,MissingTranslation;"Για να τραβήξετε φωτογραφίες ή να τραβήξετε βίντεο\, μεταβείτε στις ρυθμίσεις της εφαρμογής\, επιλέξτε \"Άδειες\" και ενεργοποιήστε την \"Κάμερα\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,774,V4046160a0,b30461614f,MissingTranslation;"Para tomar fotos o videos\, vaya a la configuración de aplicaciones\, seleccione \"Permisos\" y habilite \"Cámara\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,775,V4044f57f6,b2044f58a4,MissingTranslation;"Pildistamiseks ja videote salvestamiseks ava rakenduse seadistused\, sealt „Õigused“ / „Load“ ning luba „Kaamera“.";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,776,V4042f4bf8,f8042f4cec,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat-ek kamerara sarbidea behar du argazkiak edo bideoak ateratzeko\, baina behin betiko ukatu zaio. Joan aplikazioaren ezarpen menura\, hautatu \"Baimenak\" eta gaitu \"Kamera\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,777,V403f533bb,a903f53460,MissingTranslation;"برای گرفتن فیلم و عکس به app settings بروید و \"Permissions\" را انتخاب کرده و \"Camera\" را فعال کنید.";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,778,V4033efd61,af033efe0c,MissingTranslation;"Ottaaksesi kuvia tai videoita mene sovelluksen asetuksiin\, valitse \"Käyttöluvat\" ja kytke päälle \"Kamera\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,779,V404335a0e,da04335ae4,MissingTranslation;"Pour prendre des photos ou filmer des vidéos\, aller au menu Paramètres de l'application\, sélectionnez \"Autorisations\" et autorisez \"Appareil photo\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,780,V4044f56f0,a6044f5792,MissingTranslation;"Para facer fotos ou vídeos\, vai aos axustes da aplicación\, escolle \"Permisos\"\, e activa \"Cámara\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,781,V403cd2f5f,14903cd30a4,MissingTranslation;"A fényképek-\, videók- vagy QR-kódok rögzítéséhez lépjen a rendszer beállításaiba\, válassza ki a „Alkalmazások és értesítések” menüpontot\, válassza ki az DeltaChat alkalmazást\, majd koppintson az „Engedélyek” menüpontra\, és engedélyezze a hozzáférést a „Kamerához”.";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,782,V4021b8b74,b2021b8c22,MissingTranslation;"Untuk mengambil foto atau merekam video\, lihat pengaturan aplikasi\, pilih \"Perizinan\"\, dan aktifkan \"Kamera\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,783,V404615cf9,be04615db3,MissingTranslation;"Per scattare foto o registrare video\, vai alle impostazioni dell'app\, seleziona \"Autorizzazioni\" e abilita \"Fotocamera\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,785,V4041f3faf,b7041f4062,MissingTranslation;"Akken ad d-teṭṭfeḍ tiwlafin neɣ tividyutin\, ddu ɣer iɣewwaṛen n usnas\, fren \" tisirag \"\, sakin rmed \" takamirat \".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,786,V4029ca2f3,7e029ca36d,MissingTranslation;"사진을 찍거나 동영상을 캡처하려면 앱 설정으로 이동하여 \"권한\"을 선택하고 \"카메라\"를 활성화하십시오.";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,789,V4044f5a02,b5044f5ab3,MissingTranslation;"Delta Chat wil foto's en video's kunnen maken. Ga naar de app-instellingen\, kies ‘Rechten’ en schakel ‘Camera’ in.";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,790,V404735d83,ad04735e2c,MissingTranslation;"Aby robić zdjęcia lub nagrywać filmy\, przejdź do ustawień aplikacji\, wybierz „Uprawnienia” i włącz „Aparat”.";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,791,V402329925,12602329a47,MissingTranslation;"O Delta Chat necessita de permissão de acesso à Câmera para tirar fotos ou vídeos\, mas o acesso foi negado permanentemente. Por favor\, continue no menu de configurações do aplicativo\, selecione \"Permissões\" e active \"Câmera\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,792,V403970ac9,ef03970bb4,MissingTranslation;"O Delta Chat precisa acessar sua câmera para tirar fotos e gravar vídeos\, mas o acesso foi negado. Por favor\, habilite a câmera nas configurações de permissões do aplicativo.";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,794,V40473607e,bf04736139,MissingTranslation;"Чтобы делать фотографии\, снимать видео\, откройте настройки приложения\, выберите \"Разрешения\" и включите доступ к \"Камере\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,796,V4038b08e8,c8038b09ac,MissingTranslation;"Ak chcete fotografovať alebo snímať videá\, prejdite do nastavení aplikácie\, vyberte možnosť „Povolenia“ a povoľte možnosť „Fotoaparát“.";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,797,V40447552e,b7044755e1,MissingTranslation;"Që të mund të bëhen foto apo video\, kaloni te rregullimet e aplikacionit\, përzgjidhni “Leje” dhe aktivizoni “Kamerën”.";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,798,V402fcd8a4,b902fcd959,MissingTranslation;"Да бисте снимили фотографије или видео снимке\, идите на подешавања апликације\, изаберите „Дозволе“ и омогућите „Камеру“.";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,799,V4041140ef,ab04114196,MissingTranslation;"Gå till programinställningarna och aktivera \"Kamera\" under \"Behörighet\"\, för att ta foton eller filma.";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,800,V4043b4c9f,ba043b4d55,MissingTranslation;"Fotoğraflar çekmek ya da videolar yakalamak için uygulama ayarlarına gidin\, “İzinler”i seçin ve “Kamera”yı etkinleştirin.";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,801,V4047360c5,b804736179,MissingTranslation;"Щоб робити фотографії або знімати відео\, перейдіть до налаштувань програми оберіть \"Дозволи\" та увімкніть \"Камера\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,802,V402fee0fe,a102fee19b,MissingTranslation;"Để chụp ảnh hoặc quay video\, hãy chuyển tới cài đặt ứng dụng\, chọn \"Quyền\" và bật \"Máy ảnh\".";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,803,V4043d0ce0,60043d0d3c,MissingTranslation;"要拍照或录像，请转到应用设置，选择“权限”，然后启用“相机”。";perm_explain_access_to_camera_denied,804,V4040d020a,65040d026b,MissingTranslation;"要拍照或攝錄影片，請轉到應用程式設定，選擇「存取權」，然後啟用「相機」。";camera,764,V400cd2e36,2900cd2e5b,MissingTranslation;"Camera";camera,813,V400400bf1,2e00400c1b,MissingTranslation;"آلة التصوير";camera,765,V4006111d0,29006111f5,MissingTranslation;"Kamera";camera,766,V400a125de,2900a12603,MissingTranslation;"Камера";camera,805,V400b52740,2a00b52766,MissingTranslation;"شؽواتگر";camera,767,V400cd30aa,2900cd30cf,MissingTranslation;"Càmera";camera,768,V40073170c,2900731731,MissingTranslation;"کامێرا";camera,769,V400e133c7,2d00e133f0,MissingTranslation;"Fotoaparát";camera,770,V4007e1928,29007e194d,MissingTranslation;"Kamera";camera,771,V400cd2ff6,2900cd301b,MissingTranslation;"Kamera";camera,772,V400901f51,2900901f76,MissingTranslation;"Κάμερα";camera,773,V400af268f,2900af26b4,MissingTranslation;"Fotilo";camera,774,V400d73248,2900d7326d,MissingTranslation;"Cámara";camera,775,V400cd3006,2a00cd302c,