arecerá aquí";tab_all_media_empty_hint,775,V4024d9c04,79024d9c79,MissingTranslation;"Ükspuha mis vestlusele lisatud meediumid saavad olema nähtavad siin.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,776,V4023b9530,7a023b95a6,MissingTranslation;"Edozein txati erantsitako multimedia-fitxategiak hemen agertuko dira.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,777,V402128856,74021288c6,MissingTranslation;"رسانه‌های به اشتراک گذاشته شده همهٔ چت‌ها در اینجا ظاهر می‌شود.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,778,V401a46bc2,7101a46c2f,MissingTranslation;"Kun keskusteluissa jaetaan mediaa\, se tulee näkymään täällä.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,779,V402419bab,8a02419c31,MissingTranslation;"Les fichiers multimédias partagés dans n'importe quelle discussion apparaîtront ici.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,780,V4024d9b4e,6f024d9bb9,MissingTranslation;"O multimedia compartido en calquera conversa amósase aquí.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,781,V402068914,7102068981,MissingTranslation;"A bármelyik csevegésben megosztott média itt fog megjelenni.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,783,V4025fa027,6e025fa091,MissingTranslation;"I media allegati in qualsiasi chat verranno mostrati qui.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,785,V4022e8e01,66022e8e63,MissingTranslation;"Imidyaten yeqqnen ɣer yal adiwenni ad d-banen da.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,787,V40202828e,6c020282f6,MissingTranslation;"Čia bus rodoma bet kuriame pokalbyje bendrinama medija.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,788,V4023f9244,62023f92a2,MissingTranslation;"Media tilknyttet denne chatten vil vises her.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,789,V4024d9d88,66024d9dea,MissingTranslation;"De in gesprekken gedeelde media verschijnen hier.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,790,V40271a19b,6a0271a201,MissingTranslation;"Tutaj pojawią się multimedia dołączone do tego czatu.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,792,V402308d34,7102308da1,MissingTranslation;"Mídias compartilhadas em qualquer bate-papo aparecerão aqui.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,793,V401956430,6f0195649b,MissingTranslation;"Materialele media partajate în orice chat vor apărea aici.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,794,V40271a423,6b0271a48a,MissingTranslation;"Медиафайлы\, из всех ваших чатов\, будут показаны здесь.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,797,V402459a9d,7102459b0a,MissingTranslation;"Këtu do të duke media e bashkëngjitur në çfarëdo fjalosjeje.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,799,V402268ee6,6402268f46,MissingTranslation;"Media delad i någon chatt kommer att visas här.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,800,V4023b9333,70023b939f,MissingTranslation;"Herhangi bir sohbete iliştirilen ortamlar burada görünecek.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,801,V40271a462,6f0271a4cd,MissingTranslation;"Тут з'являться медіа\, які прикріплені до будь-якого чату.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,802,V401946527,82019465a5,MissingTranslation;"Phương tiện được chia sẻ trong bất kỳ cuộc trò chuyện nào sẽ xuất hiện ở đây.";tab_all_media_empty_hint,803,V4023b7d1c,46023b7d5e,MissingTranslation;"任何聊天附加的媒体都将显示在此处。";tab_all_media_empty_hint,804,V4021c75a8,48021c75ec,MissingTranslation;"在任何聊天中分享的媒體都會顯示在此處。";share_abort,764,V402f5cbf8,5302f5cc47,MissingTranslation;"Sharing aborted due to missing permissions.";share_abort,765,V401093a83,4e01093acd,MissingTranslation;"İcazə olmadığına görə göndərmə kəsildi";share_abort,766,V4021c99ff,5c021c9a57,MissingTranslation;"Споделянето е прекъснато поради липсващи позволения.";share_abort,767,V402f4d8a6,5b02f4d8fd,MissingTranslation;"S'ha avortat la compartició per falta de permisos.";share_abort,769,V402d6c8bd,5502d6c90e,MissingTranslation;"Sdílení přerušeno kvůli chybějícím oprávnění.";share_abort,770,V4018059f9,5901805a4e,MissingTranslation;"Deling afbrudt på grund af manglende tilladelser.";share_abort,771,V402f4d589,5d02f4d5e2,MissingTranslation;"Teilen aufgrund fehlender Berechtigungen abgebrochen.";share_abort,772,V401c474f3,5601c47545,MissingTranslation;"Η κοινή χρήση ματαιώθηκε λόγω έλλειψης αδειών.";share_abort,773,V401825888,50018258d4,MissingTranslation;"Kunhavigado ĉesis pro manko de permesoj.";share_abort,774,V40306dc17,5b0306dc6e,MissingTranslation;"Intercambio